_1dHgqMhNwfvgfK6Ur9q-GMALDSp4cCgpw78MA1AIz8dI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfsEViwpVCMzFZpCBbchYWSSoipEK3vZlM2zwVUr-2sHrw&oe=699AFFB3"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "New_Project_3.png", "id": "1686683892204452", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391893_1686683895537785_2742684447871003937_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=AB1_Dp2lKXoQ7kNvwFFk1q7&_nc_oc=AdkxhcXD4iRm6ViHa8mKhx1fovM1au2_sG_dLjyYEzvbZp8uoKRwrozvjAlsvQqhK0g&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfsFp5e5kHQwMT1qbCGAAjQt4tmPjAtVJTqfRo0ySm64CA&oe=699AF4A9"}, "display_name": "Monkey Hub VR", "keywords": ["MonkeyHub", "Tag", "Gorilla", "Monkey", "Fangame"], "long_description": "Welcome to Monkey Hub VR!\nMonkey Hub VR is an immersive social hub with tons off fun game modes and maps such as Monke Games a crab game inspired game mode featuring unique Korean children's games or the horror mode were you break into the subliminal side of Monkey Hub VR and fight the mysterious entities.\n\nExperience a world like no other with not just your self but up to 10 players. Monkey Hub VR is a huge world with much to offer and is a place for everyone to let out there inner monkey! \ud83d\udc35 \n\nWith immersive VR gameplay, chaotic fun, and high-stakes challenges, Monkey Hub VR will push your skills to the limit.", "short_description": "Welcome to Monkey Hub VR!\nMonkey Hub VR is an immersive social hub with tons off fun game modes and maps such as Monke Games a crab game inspired game mode featuring unique Korean children's games or the horror mode were you break into the subliminal side of Monkey Hub VR and fight the mysterious entities.\n\nExperience a world like no other with not just your self but up to 10 players. Monkey Hub VR is a huge world with much to offer and is a place for everyone."}]}, "developer_name": "SpokGamez", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/monkey-hub-v